        <activityName xml:lang="en">Window frame, wood, natural/varnished, U=1.2 W/m2K, m2 visible, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Window frame, wood, natural/varnished, U=1.2 W/m2K, m2 visible, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The average visible area is 0.29m2. 1m2 of visible wooden window frame weighs 128.4kg. The bill of materials is based on data from 3 window producers.;
UUID: 169b4266-4bdf-3598-8d18-fc2881890530
Included are the materials used in a wooden window frame (with surface treatment). Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_169b4266-4bdf-3598-8d18-fc2881890530.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
